  "description": "U-Yeong gets scolded by her friends every day because of her sloppy and careless personality. She steals one thing a day and has never done anything properly in her life.\n\nA little distance from school is a dollar store. U-Yeong stands in front of the store holding a large piece of paper.\n\n\\[I will never steal anything again\\]\n\nI've been stealing stuff like this my whole life, but this is the first time I've ever been caught!\n\nU-Yeong is dizzy from a disgrace she has never experienced before. To make matters worse, her classmate Seo Ju-Hong finds out about it...\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
